cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use techne, please cite it as below.
title: "techne: a Claude Code plugin marketplace for repositories, documents, and bibliographies"
abstract: >-
  A marketplace of Claude Code plugins. techne audits builds and CI runs, checks
  documentation against code, and reviews changes before merge. graphe builds LaTeX,
  markdown, and slide documents and gates them on their output. phylax adds git guard
  hooks and restarts idle sessions onto an updated Claude Code. keryx speaks a short summary of each reply. dokimasia
  verifies a bibliography against arXiv and Crossref and checks that every cited
  key rendered. heuresis triages an idea against papers, patents, products and
  your own work. epistole gives Claude your Gmail accounts, with every send gated on
  your approval. schole reads a Brightspace course site without marking anything
  read.
